      <p class="cst-p" style="margin-top:.85em">I interviewed twelve chefs across different cuisines and restaurant sizes about how they actually manage inventory, prep and recipes. I expected to hear that the software was bad. What I heard was that the software was irrelevant, because the work happens somewhere it can't see.</p>
    </div>

